nstance of a person taking an assessment.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001541116817", "dep": null}, {"v": "Submitted", "n": "Submitted", "d": "Submitted is specified as the completion and scoring status for an instance of a person taking an assessment.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001541116967", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
SELECT public.ceds_tmp_valueset('AssessmentResultDataType', 'The data type of the assessment result score value.', NULL, 'scheme: C001543', NULL, $j$[{"v": "Integer", "n": "Integer", "d": "A positive or negative whole number or zero such as -2, 4, 4567.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001543105794", "dep": null}, {"v": "Decimal", "n": "Decimal", "d": "A representation of a real number using the base ten and decimal notation, such as 201.4, -3.89, or 0.0006", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001543105795", "dep": null}, {"v": "Percentile", "n": "Percentile", "d": "Any of 100 equal parts into which the range of the values of a set of data can be divided in order to show the distribution of those values. The part may be represented as an integer between 0 and 100, or further broken down into tenths or hundredths. (e.g. 87, 5.2, 45.74)", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001543105796", "dep": null}, {"v": "String", "n": "String", "d": "A string representative of a non-numeric or numeric range value.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001543105797", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
SELECT public.ceds_tmp_valueset('AssessmentResultScoreType', 'Indicates the purpose for which this assessment score instance was recorded.', NULL, 'scheme: C001547', NULL, $j$[{"v": "Initial", "n": "An initial assessment score instance.", "d": "An initial assessment score instance.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001547105798", "dep": null}, {"v": "Reliability", "n": "An assessment score instance recorded as a measure of reliability", "d": "An assessment score instance recorded as a measure of reliability", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001547105799", "dep": null}, {"v": "Resolution", "n": "An assessment score instance recorded after resolution of scoring or data issues.", "d": "An assessment score instance recorded after resolution of scoring or data issues.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001547105800", "dep": null}, {"v": "Backread", "n": "An assessment score recorded to determine whether or not each individual scorer is correctly applying the scoring guide to student responses.", "d": "An assessment score recorded to determine whether or not each individual scorer is correctly applying the scoring guide to student responses.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001547105801", "dep": null}, {"v": "Final", "n": "The final assessment score instance.", "d": "The final assessment score instance.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001547105802", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
