e", "d": "Principal's office is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128536", "dep": null}, {"v": "02754", "n": "PTO/PTA spaces", "d": "PTO/PTA spaces is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128537", "dep": null}, {"v": "02756", "n": "Records room/vault", "d": "Records room/vault is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128538", "dep": null}, {"v": "02753", "n": "School bank", "d": "School bank is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128539", "dep": null}, {"v": "02752", "n": "School store", "d": "School store is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128540", "dep": null}, {"v": "02749", "n": "Security/police/probation office", "d": "Security/police/probation office is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128541", "dep": null}, {"v": "02755", "n": "Site-based council office", "d": "Site-based council office is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128542", "dep": null}, {"v": "02750", "n": "Staff lounge", "d": "Staff lounge is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128543", "dep": null}, {"v": "02751", "n": "Staff work room", "d": "Staff work room is specified as the space designed primarily for conducting administrative and business functions.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001813128544", "