ce is satellite.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001936162247", "dep": null}, {"v": "Unknown", "n": "Unknown", "d": "It is not known whether there is internet service in the individual's primary place of residence.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI001936162248", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
