ept: NI000617113924", "dep": null}, {"v": "03023", "n": "Stadium", "d": "The incident occurred in a stadium.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113925", "dep": null}, {"v": "03024", "n": "Parking lot", "d": "The incident occurred in a parking lot.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113926", "dep": null}, {"v": "03025", "n": "On-campus other outside area", "d": "The incident occurred in on-campus other outside area.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113927", "dep": null}, {"v": "03026", "n": "Off campus", "d": "The incident occurred in off campus.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113928", "dep": null}, {"v": "03027", "n": "Bus stop", "d": "The incident occurred at a bus stop.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113929", "dep": null}, {"v": "03028", "n": "School bus", "d": "The incident occurred on a school bus.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113930", "dep": null}, {"v": "03029", "n": "Walking to or from school", "d": "The incident occurred walking to or from school.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113931", "dep": null}, {"v": "03030", "n": "Off-campus at other school", "d": "The incident occurred off-campus at other school.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113932", "dep": null}, {"v": "03031", "n": "Off-campus at other school district facility", "d": "The incident occurred off-campus at other school district facility.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113933", "dep": null}, {"v": "03413", "n": "Online", "d": "The incident occurred online.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617113995", "dep": null}, {"v": "09997", "n": "Unknown", "d": "The location where the incident occurred is unknown.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617114347", "dep": null}, {"v": "13773", "n": "Off-campus at a school sponsored activity", "d": "The incident occurred off-campus at a school sponsored activity.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617114547", "dep": null}, {"v": "13774", "n": "Off-campus at another location unrelated to school", "d": "The incident occurred off-campus at another location unrelated to school.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000617114548", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
SELECT public.ceds_tmp_valueset('PersonalInformationVerification', 'The evidence by which a persons name, address, date of birth, etc. is confirmed.', NULL, 'scheme: C000618', NULL, $j$[{"v": "01003", "n": "Baptismal or church certificate", "d": "Baptismal or church certificate was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151886", "dep": null}, {"v": "01004", "n": "Birth certificate", "d": "Birth certificate was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151887", "dep": null}, {"v": "01005", "n": "Entry in family Bible", "d": "Entry in family Bible was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151888", "dep": null}, {"v": "01006", "n": "Hospital certificate", "d": "Hospital certificate was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151889", "dep": null}, {"v": "01007", "n": "Parent's affidavit", "d": "Parent's affidavit was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151890", "dep": null}, {"v": "01008", "n": "Passport", "d": "Passport was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151891", "dep": null}, {"v": "01009", "n": "Physician's certificate", "d": "Physician's certificate was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151892", "dep": null}, {"v": "01010", "n": "Previously verified school records", "d": "Previously verified school records was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151893", "dep": null}, {"v": "01011", "n": "State-issued ID", "d": "State-issued ID was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151894", "dep": null}, {"v": "01012", "n": "Driver's license", "d": "Driver's license was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151895", "dep": null}, {"v": "01013", "n": "Immigration document/visa", "d": "Immigration document/visa was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151896", "dep": null}, {"v": "02382", "n": "Life insurance policy", "d": "Life insurance policy was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151897", "dep": null}, {"v": "03423", "n": "Other official document", "d": "Other official document was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151898", "dep": null}, {"v": "03424", "n": "Other non-official document", "d": "Other non-official document was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151899", "dep": null}, {"v": "09999", "n": "Other", "d": "Evidence used to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc. is in a category not yet defined in CEDS.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151900", "dep": null}, {"v": "73095", "n": "Approved Transfer", "d": "An approved student transfer in the student information system was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151901", "dep": null}, {"v": "73102", "n": "Birth Registration Form", "d": "A birth registration form was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151902", "dep": null}, {"v": "73097", "n": "Citizenship Card", "d": "A citizenship card was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151903", "dep": null}, {"v": "73100", "n": "Lease Agreement", "d": "A lease agreement was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151904", "dep": null}, {"v": "73093", "n": "Non-Parent Affidavit of Residence", "d": "A non-parent's affidavit of residency was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151905", "dep": null}, {"v": "73094", "n": "Parent's Affidavit of Residence", "d": "A parent/guardian affidavit of residency was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151906", "dep": null}, {"v": "73101", "n": "Purchase Agreement", "d": "A purchase agreement was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151907", "dep": null}, {"v": "73092", "n": "Residence Verification Form", "d": "A form verifying residency was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151908", "dep": null}, {"v": "73098", "n": "Tax Bill", "d": "A tax bill was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151909", "dep": null}, {"v": "73091", "n": "Telephone Bill", "d": "A telephone bill was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151910", "dep": null}, {"v": "73099", "n": "Utility Bill", "d": "A utility bill was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151911", "dep": null}, {"v": "73096", "n": "Water Bill", "d": "A water bill was used as evidence to verify a person's name, address, date of birth, etc.", "u": null, "notes": "concept: NI000618151912", "dep": null}]$j$::jsonb);
